              "id": "CVE-2014-3625",
              "shortDescription": {
                 "text": "medium severity - CVE-2014-3625 Improper Limitation of a Pathname to a Restricted Directory ('Path Traversal') vulnerability in document-service-0.0.1-SNAPSHOT.jar: spring-kafka-4.0.5.jar"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Directory traversal vulnerability in Pivotal Spring Framework 3.0.4 through 3.2.x before 3.2.12, 4.0.x before 4.0.8, and 4.1.x before 4.1.2 allows remote attackers to read arbitrary files via unspecified vectors, related to static resource handling."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "For more information see [CVE-2014-3625](https://web.nvd.nist.gov/view/vuln/detail?vulnId=CVE-2014-3625).\n\n\nIf this is a false positive - consider using the HTML report to generate a suppression file.\nFor more information see [How dependency-check works](https://dependency-check.github.io/DependencyCheck/general/internals.html),\n[How to read the HTML report](https://dependency-check.github.io/DependencyCheck/general/thereport.html), and\n[Suppressing false positives](https://dependency-check.github.io/DependencyCheck/general/suppression.html)."
