                 "text": "medium severity - CVE-2026-41853 Inconsistent Interpretation of HTTP Requests ('HTTP Request\/Response Smuggling') vulnerability in document-service-0.0.1-SNAPSHOT.jar: spring-core-7.0.7.jar"
